        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ Motorized Electric Latch Retraction Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty rim exit device for  use on \"Fire Labeled\" medium and high traffic commercial, hospitality, institutional applications. Suitable for all doors (hollow metal or wood), durable enough for the most demanding applications. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<B>Motorized Latch Retraction</b>: Ultra quiet operation unique motor drive retracts Push Pad. Low power requirements. Interfaces with <a href=\"/products/low-voltage-power-supply-pdq-81440\">PDQ’s 81440 2A 24VDC Filtered Power Supply</b></a>. Suitable for pairing with Low Energy Power Operators. On-board diagnostic LED lights. Motor drive factory tested to over 500,000 cycles (Over 2 times the ANSI/BHMA 156.25 Grade 1 Standard).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor <b>36\" Wide Fire Doors</b>, furnished standard with sex nuts. Listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure. ANSI/BHMA <b>Certified Grade 1</b>, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices. “Fire Exit Hardware” labeled for up to 3 hours, Non-handed. reversible for left or right hand doors. Compliant with the 2014 Florida Building Code, which include a High Velocity Hurricane Zone (HVHZ) Product Approval: FL 21376. Meets requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* <a href=\"/products/low-voltage-power-supply-pdq-81440\">PDQ 81440  Power Supply</a> is Required and Not supplied (Sold Separately).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for PDQ 6200RF630MLR Electric Latch Retraction Panic Device\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Chassis:</b> Cadmium plated steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Rail:</b> Extruded aluminum</li>\r\n<li><b>Touch Pad:</b> Stainless steel, 18\" wide</li>\r\n<li><b>Latch Bolt:</b> Stainless steel dead locking with 3/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li><b>Projection:</b> 3-1/8” projection</li>\r\n<li><b>Hand:</b> Device is non-handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Dogging:</b> None (Fire rated, non-dogging)</li>\r\n<li><b>Application:</b> Rim  (8'0\" tall door standard) / Covers 161 door prep</li>\r\n<li><b>Stile Width:</b> 4-1/4\" minimum</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Thickness:</b> 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Width:</b> Standard for 3'0\" door (36\" wide door)</li>\r\n<li><b>Certifications:</b> U.L./U.L.C. listed for “Panic”, “Fire Exit hardware” labeled for up to 3 hour for 4’0” x 8’0” maximum single, 8’0” x 8’0”\r\nmaximum pairs / Complies with U.L. 10C and UBC 7.2 (1997).  ANSI/BHMA Certified Grade 1, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices.</li>\r\n<li><b>Warranty:</b> Ten (10) year limited warranty mechanical components</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish:</b> <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6200R-template.pdf?v=1704262246\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 6200R Installation Template  (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Motorized Electric Latch Rim Exit Device, PDQ 6200RF630MLR",
                "description": "Heavy duty rim exit device for  use on Fire Labeled\"medium and high traffic commercial, hospitality, institutional applications. Ultra quite operation unique motor drive retracts Push Pad. Low power requirements. Interfaces with PDQ’s 81440 2A 24VDC Filtered. Suitable for pairing with Low Energy Power Operators. On-board diagnostic LED lights. Motor drive factory tested to over 500,000 cycles (Over 2 times the ANSI/BHMA 156.25 Grade 1 Standard).",
